# kk: add propagate invariant option for pre-rasterization shader geometry
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/46519 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?
<!-- Describe in detail what your merge request does and why. -->

AI was used to investigate the flickering issue in the mentioned game. I contemplated having it on by default always as RADV does, but decided not to. If more games hit the same issue, we can revisit.

```
kk: add propagate invariant option for pre-rasterization shader geometry

Certain apps expect geometry outputs to be invariant even when they don't
declare them in shaders. Marvel's Future Fight is one of those.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Aitor Camacho <aitor@lunarg.com>
```
